          <tr style="background: #fff;"><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#0D2137;vertical-align:top;">IRS SECURE 2.0 Act — RMD Start Age</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#0D2137;vertical-align:top;">RMD start age increased to 73 for those turning 72 after December 31, 2022</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;vertical-align:top;"><a href="https://www.irs.gov/retirement-plans/required-minimum-distributions-for-ira-beneficiaries" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0A3D3A;text-decoration:underline;">IRS RMD Rules</a></td></tr>
        </tbody>
